Data and generated artifacts
----------------------------

This repository does not apply a blanket license to source data, imported
plans, maps, shapefiles, election records, Census material, or other
third-party inputs. Those materials retain their source-specific public-domain,
license, attribution, privacy, and use terms.

Generated and derived artifacts may combine BISECT-authored material with
source data. Their reuse requires compliance with every identified source term
and provenance record. Synthetic software test fixtures are covered by the MIT
License unless their file says otherwise.

Third-party dependencies and material remain subject to their own licenses.
